4337	1025	11	sequential_diagnostic	The evolutionary sequence of major plant groups in order of their appearance and adaptation for terrestrial life is given below. Select the correct diagnostic evolutionary sequence from early to advanced forms.	\N	The evolutionary lineage of plants progressed from non-vascular land plants (Bryophytes) to seedless vascular plants, followed by naked seed plants (Gymnosperms), and finally flowering plants enclosed in an ovary (Angiosperms). This matches sequence B.	1	evaluate	difficult	["A. Bryophytes \\u2192 Seedless vascular plants \\u2192 Gymnosperms \\u2192 Angiosperms", "B. Bryophytes \\u2192 Seedless vascular plants \\u2192 Angiosperms \\u2192 Gymnosperms", "C. Seedless vascular plants \\u2192 Bryophytes \\u2192 Gymnosperms \\u2192 Angiosperms", "D. Gymnosperms \\u2192 Bryophytes \\u2192 Seedless vascular plants \\u2192 Angiosperms", "E. Angiosperms \\u2192 Gymnosperms \\u2192 Seedless vascular plants \\u2192 Bryophytes"]	A	\N	\N	null	{"sequence_steps": ["Bryophytes", "Seedless vascular plants", "Gymnosperms", "Angiosperms"], "correct_sequence": null, "colIHeader": "", "colIIHeader": "", "colI": [], "colII": [], "formula": "", "given_values": ""}	null	null	2026-08-19 20:25:29.69498	\N	{"id": 4337, "points": 1.0, "exam_id": 1025, "options": ["A. Bryophytes → Seedless vascular plants → Gymnosperms → Angiosperms", "B. Bryophytes → Seedless vascular plants → Angiosperms → Gymnosperms", "C. Seedless vascular plants → Bryophytes → Gymnosperms → Angiosperms", "D. Gymnosperms → Bryophytes → Seedless vascular plants → Angiosperms", "E. Angiosperms → Gymnosperms → Seedless vascular plants → Bryophytes"], "stem_text": "The evolutionary sequence of major plant groups in order of their appearance and adaptation for terrestrial life is given below. Select the correct diagnostic evolutionary sequence from early to advanced forms.", "difficulty": "difficult", "diagram_url": null, "explanation": "The evolutionary lineage of plants progressed fro